          ],
          "content": "Rotating a square does not change its lengths and angles."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.164,
            0.651,
            0.21
          ],
          "content": "Therefore, this rotated figure satisfies both the properties of a square and so, it is a square."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.211,
            0.65,
            0.255
          ],
          "content": "By the same reasoning, a rotated rectangle is still a rectangle."
        },
