        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.304,
            0.884,
            0.346
          ],
          "content": "1. Draw the rectangle and four squares configuration (shown in Fig. 8.3) on a dot paper."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.244,
            0.352,
            0.885,
            0.416
          ],
          "content": "What did you do to recreate this figure so that the four squares are placed symmetrically around the rectangle? Discuss with your classmates."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.421,
            0.884,
            0.463
          ],
          "content": "2. Identify if there are any squares in this collection. Use measurements if needed."
